1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:01,333
What do you mean by that?

2
00:00:01,418 --> 00:00:03,628
Turns out, the principal
is a big baseball fan.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,047
But he was so angry
because we kept losing

4
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:08,258
so he said he will
shut down the baseball club.

5
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:11,094
And it looks like he
watched our game!

6
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:11,428
What?

7
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:13,638
Maybe he was moved by

8
00:00:13,638 --> 00:00:16,433
our improvement
and our determination to win.

9
00:00:16,558 --> 00:00:18,018
He said we should
keep doing this!

10
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:18,977
Anyway

11
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:21,479
the couch just summoned
us to the lodge

12
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:22,480
so you guys come quickly!

13
00:00:22,772 --> 00:00:25,108
He's throwing us a party with
fried chicken!

14
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:26,275
I'll see you there!

15
00:00:27,444 --> 00:00:28,444
Whew.

16
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:31,114
Thank God, it went well.

17
00:00:31,823 --> 00:00:32,823
That old man

18
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,492
seemed very determined
to shut us down

19
00:00:34,492 --> 00:00:35,910
but looks like
he was a good guy.

20
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:39,788
Are you crying?

21
00:00:40,832 --> 00:00:41,416
Why...

22
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:42,624
Why are you crying?

23
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:46,295
I'm so happy.

24
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:48,125
I'm so happy for everything.

25
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:54,095
We can keep playing
baseball together!

26
00:00:58,933 --> 00:00:59,933
Let's

27
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,260
keep playing
baseball together.

28
00:01:01,853 --> 00:01:02,853
And

29
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:04,063
let's win next time.

30
00:01:07,442 --> 00:01:08,442
Yes.

31
00:01:09,778 --> 00:01:11,321
So that we can
keep playing together.

32
00:01:33,093 --> 00:01:34,385
We'll do it together.

33
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:36,387
We're partners!

34
00:01:36,679 --> 00:01:37,679
Yeah.

35
00:01:38,389 --> 00:01:39,628
Let's keep going together.
